Package: global-menu
Source: global-menu
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: unmade.space <https://github.com/Unmade760>
Depends: python3-gi, python3-dbus, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, appmenu-gtk3-module, python3:any
Recommends: gir1.2-bamf-3, bamfdaemon, gir1.2-keybinder-3.0
Suggests: libdbusmenu-glib4
Section: python
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Unmade760/orbit-global-menu
Description: Companion daemon for the Global Menu GNOME Shell extension.
 Reads the menu an application exports over D-Bus and hands it to the
 extension, which draws it in the GNOME panel.
